      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\t- Links:\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/liberated-pixel-cup-lpc-base-assets-sprites-map-tiles\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-medieval-fantasy-character-sprites\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-expanded-pants\n\nfeet/shoes/basic/male/walk.png\n\t- Note: original by wulax, edited for v3 base by bluecarrot16, Jump/Sit/Emote/Run/Revised Combat by JaidynReiman\n\t- Licenses:\n\t\t- OGA-BY 3.0\n\t\t- CC-BY-SA 3.0\n\t\t- GPL 3.0\n\t- Authors:\n\t\t- JaidynReiman\n\t\t- bluecarrot16\n\t\t- Johannes Sj\xF6lund (wulax)\n\t- Links:\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-medieval-fantasy-character-sprites\n\t\t- http://opengameart.org/content/lpc-clothing-updates\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-expanded-socks-shoes\n\nhat/formal/bowler/adult/walk/tan.png\n\t- Licenses:\n\t\t- CC-BY-SA 3.0\n\t\t- GPL 3.0\n\t- Authors:\n\t\t- bluecarrot16\n\t- Links:\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-gentleman\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-expanded-hats-facial-helmets\n\n--- Personaje LPC: Aurelio (69) ---\nArchivo(s): aurelio_69_walk.png\nAutor(es): bluecarrot16, JaidynReiman, Benjamin K. Smith (BenCreating), Evert, Eliza Wyatt (ElizaWy), TheraHedwig, MuffinElZangano, Durrani, Johannes Sj\xF6lund (wulax), Stephen Challener (Redshrike), ElizaWy, Manuel Riecke (MrBeast), Joe White, Nila122, Matthew Krohn (makrohn)\nLicencia: MIXTA por capa (no hay una sola licencia com\xFAn a todas las capas; hay que cumplir la de cada capa, ver lista literal abajo)\n  Licencias presentes en las capas: OGA-BY 3.0, CC-BY-SA 3.0, GPL 3.0, CC-BY 3.0, CC0, GPL 2.0\nFuente: https://liberatedpixelcup.github.io/Universal-LPC-Spritesheet-Character-Generator/#?sex=male&body=Body_Color_bronze&head=Human_Male_Elderly_bronze&expression=Neutral_bronze&wrinkles=Wrinkles_bronze&hair=Plain_gray&clothes=Longsleeve_white&apron=Apron_white&legs=Pants_brown&shoes=Basic_Shoes_brown&eyes=Eye_Color_brown\nModificaci\xF3n propia: el generador no aplica el color de ojos a la cara \"elderly\"; los p\xEDxeles de ojo azul se recolorearon a caf\xE9 a mano (paleta caf\xE9 del propio generador).\nModificaci\xF3n propia (2026-09-22): ese recoloreado dej\xF3 336 px del rabillo de cada ojo en cian (108,220,231); se sustituyeron por el blanco de ojo de la propia paleta LPC (242,247,248), que es el color que el generador pone en ese mismo p\xEDxel en las caras no \"elderly\".\nCr\xE9ditos literales del generador/p\xE1gina:\nbody/bodies/male/walk.png\n\t- Note: see details at https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-character-bases; 'Thick' Male Revised Run/Climb by JaidynReiman (based on ElizaWy's LPC Revised)\n\t- Licenses:\n\t\t- OGA-BY 3.0\n\t\t- CC-BY-SA 3.0\n\t\t- GPL 3.0\n\t- Authors:\n\t\t- bluecarrot16\n\t\t- JaidynReiman\n\t\t- Benjamin K. Smith (BenCreating)\n\t\t- Evert\n\t\t- Eliza Wyatt (ElizaWy)\n\t\t- TheraHedwig\n\t\t- MuffinElZangano\n\t\t- Durrani\n\t\t- Johannes Sj\xF6lund (wulax)\n\t\t- Stephen Challener (Redshrike)\n\t- Links:\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/liberated-pixel-cup-lpc-base-assets-sprites-map-tiles\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-medieval-fantasy-character-sprites\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-male-jumping-animation-by-durrani\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-runcycle-and-diagonal-walkcycle\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-revised-character-basics\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-be-seated\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-runcycle-for-male-muscular-and-pregnant-character-bases-with-modular-heads\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-jump-expanded\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-character-bases\n\nhead/heads/human/male_elderly/walk.png\n\t- Licenses:\n\t\t- OGA-BY 3.0\n\t\t- CC-BY 3.0\n\t- Authors:\n\t\t- Benjamin K. Smith (BenCreating)\n\t\t- Eliza Wyatt (ElizaWy)\n\t\t- Stephen Challener (Redshrike)\n\t- Links:\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/liberated-pixel-cup-lpc-base-assets-sprites-map-tiles\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-revised-elders\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-character-bases\n\nhead/faces/elderly/neutral/walk.png\n\t- Note: Original by Redshrike, Expressions by ElizaWy, mapped to all frames by JaidynReiman\n\t- Licenses:\n\t\t- OGA-BY 3.0\n\t- Authors:\n\t\t- JaidynReiman\n\t\t- ElizaWy\n\t\t- Stephen Challener (Redshrike)\n\t- Links:\n\t\t- https://github.com/ElizaWy/LPC/tree/main/Characters/Head\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/ulpc-expanded-expressions\n\nhead/wrinkles/walk.png\n\t- Licenses:\n\t\t- CC0\n\t- Authors:\n\t\t- bluecarrot16\n\t- Links:\n\t\t- \n\nhair/plain/adult/walk.png\n\t- Licenses:\n\t\t- OGA-BY 3.0\n\t\t- CC-BY-SA 3.0\n\t\t- GPL 3.0\n\t- Authors:\n\t\t- JaidynReiman\n\t\t- Manuel Riecke (MrBeast)\n\t\t- Joe White\n\t- Links:\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/liberated-pixel-cup-lpc-base-assets-sprites-map-tiles\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/ponytail-and-plain-hairstyles\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-expanded-hair\n\ntorso/clothes/longsleeve/longsleeve/male/walk.png\n\t- Note: original by wulax; tweaks and further recolors by bluecarrot16; cleanup and climb/jump/run/sit/emote/revised combat adapted from LPC Revised by JaidynReiman\n\t- Licenses:\n\t\t- OGA-BY 3.0\n\t\t- CC-BY-SA 3.0\n\t\t- GPL 3.0\n\t- Authors:\n\t\t- JaidynReiman\n\t\t- Johannes Sj\xF6lund (wulax)\n\t- Links:\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-medieval-fantasy-character-sprites\n\t\t- http://opengameart.org/content/lpc-clothing-updates\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-revised-character-basics\n\t\t- https://github.com/ElizaWy/LPC/tree/main/Characters/Clothing\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-expanded-sit-run-jump-more\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-expanded-simple-shirts\n\ntorso/aprons/apron/male/walk/white.png\n\t- Licenses:\n\t\t- OGA-BY 3.0\n\t\t- CC-BY-SA 3.0\n\t\t- GPL 2.0\n\t\t- GPL 3.0\n\t- Authors:\n\t\t- Nila122\n\t- Links:\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-aprons\n\nlegs/pants/male/walk.png\n\t- Note: original male pants by wulax, recolors and edits to v3 base by bluecarrot16, climb/jump/run/sit/emotes/revised combat by JaidynReiman based on ElizaWy's LPC Revised\n\t- Licenses:\n\t\t- OGA-BY 3.0\n\t\t- GPL 3.0\n\t\t- CC-BY-SA 3.0\n\t- Authors:\n\t\t- bluecarrot16\n\t\t- JaidynReiman\n\t\t- ElizaWy\n\t\t- Matthew Krohn (makrohn)\n\t\t- Johannes Sj\xF6lund (wulax)\n"
