  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-expanded-sit-run-jump-more\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-expanded-simple-shirts\n\ntorso/aprons/apron/male/walk/white.png\n\t- Licenses:\n\t\t- OGA-BY 3.0\n\t\t- CC-BY-SA 3.0\n\t\t- GPL 2.0\n\t\t- GPL 3.0\n\t- Authors:\n\t\t- Nila122\n\t- Links:\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-aprons\n\nlegs/pants/male/walk.png\n\t- Note: original male pants by wulax, recolors and edits to v3 base by bluecarrot16, climb/jump/run/sit/emotes/revised combat by JaidynReiman based on ElizaWy's LPC Revised\n\t- Licenses:\n\t\t- OGA-BY 3.0\n\t\t- GPL 3.0\n\t\t- CC-BY-SA 3.0\n\t- Authors:\n\t\t- bluecarrot16\n\t\t- JaidynReiman\n\t\t- ElizaWy\n\t\t- Matthew Krohn (makrohn)\n\t\t- Johannes Sj\xF6lund (wulax)\n\t\t- Stephen Challener (Redshrike)\n\t- Links:\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/liberated-pixel-cup-lpc-base-assets-sprites-map-tiles\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-medieval-fantasy-character-sprites\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-expanded-pants\n\nfeet/shoes/basic/male/walk.png\n\t- Note: original by wulax, edited for v3 base by bluecarrot16, Jump/Sit/Emote/Run/Revised Combat by JaidynReiman\n\t- Licenses:\n\t\t- OGA-BY 3.0\n\t\t- CC-BY-SA 3.0\n\t\t- GPL 3.0\n\t- Authors:\n\t\t- JaidynReiman\n\t\t- bluecarrot16\n\t\t- Johannes Sj\xF6lund (wulax)\n\t- Links:\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-medieval-fantasy-character-sprites\n\t\t- http://opengameart.org/content/lpc-clothing-updates\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-expanded-socks-shoes\n\n\n==================== PARTE B \u2014 OPENGAMEART.ORG ====================\n\n--- Perro LPC (\"[LPC] Cats and Dogs\") ---\nArchivo(s): tizne_dog.png\nAutor(es): bluecarrot16\nLicencia: CC-BY 3.0 / CC-BY-SA 3.0 / GPL 3.0 / GPL 2.0 / OGA-BY 3.0 (la p\xE1gina ofrece estas opciones; elige una)\nFuente: https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-cats-and-dogs\nCr\xE9ditos literales del generador/p\xE1gina:\nCopyright/Attribution Notice: \"[LPC] Cats and Dogs\" Artist: bluecarrot16 License: CC-BY 3.0 / GPL 3.0 / GPL 2.0 / OGA-BY 3.0 Please link to opengameart: http://opengameart.org/content/lpc-cats-and-dogs\nDescripci\xF3n: Cats and Dogs in the style of the Liberated Pixel Cup; walk animations in all 4 directions and some bonus sleeping images and eating animations. Four colors each.\nObras derivadas: tizne_collar.png, tizne_sombrero.png y tizne_ambos.png \u2014 variante negra de esta hoja con collar y sombrero de palma dibujados encima por Fortino Romero Mantilla; se distribuyen con la misma licencia que la hoja original.\n\n--- Interior de casa (\"[LPC] House Insides\") ---\nArchivo(s): tileset_interior/house_inside.png\nAutor(es): Lanea Zimmerman (AKA Sharm), William.Thompsonj (colaboradores: Sharm, HughSpectrum)\nLicencia: CC-BY-SA 3.0 / GPL 3.0 (la p\xE1gina ofrece estas opciones; elige una)\nFuente: https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-house-insides\nCr\xE9ditos literales del generador/p\xE1gina:\nDescripci\xF3n: This is a repack of the base LPC assets, plus some fixed stuff. Here's a rundown of what was modified: cabinets.png -> Stuff was stacked too tightly to be usable as a 32x32 tileset. Moved tiles away from each other that were too close. castle_light_sources.png -> Repositioned torches to take 1/4 the space. country.png -> Nothing. inside.png -> Made background transparent and removed redundant tiles. kitchen.png -> Nothing. victoria.png -> Shifted chairs to make 2-tile versions like those in country.png\n\n--- Muebles de cocina/sala (\"[LPC] House interior and decorations\") ---\nArchivo(s): tileset_interior/LPC_house_interior.zip (archivo oficial LPC_house_interior_0.zip)\nAutor(es): Reemax (colaboradores: Sharm, Hyptosis, daneeklu, William.Thompsonj, wulax, makrohn)\nLicencia: CC-BY-SA 3.0 / GPL 3.0 / GPL 2.0 (la p\xE1gina ofrece estas opciones; elige una)\nFuente: https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-house-interior-and-decorations\nCr\xE9ditos literales del generador/p\xE1gina:\nCopyright/Attribution Notice: See credits.txt\nDescripci\xF3n: Collections of house interior and decorations. Scaled down cabinets to to fit 32x64 pixels. Bed scaled to 32x96. Cabinets top and down parts can be changed between freely. Same with kitchen equipment. Metal stove and kitchen stove both have animated fire. These are based on LPC but quite heavily modified. Preview image containsd walls from http://opengameart.org/content/lpc-guido-bos-entries-cut-up and wooden floor from LPC base tiles.\n[Contenido de credits.txt incluido en el ZIP LPC_house_interior_0.zip]\n= Wooden floor(CC-BY-SA) =\n * Horizontal wooden floor by Lanea Zimmerman (AKA Sharm)\n * Horizontal wooden floor with hole by Lanea Zimmerman (AKA Sharm) and Tuomo Untinen\n * Vertical wooden floor by Tuomo Untinen\n * Vertical wooden floor with hole by Tuomo Untinen\n= Wooden wall topping (CC-BY-SA) =\n * Tuomo Untinen\n= Pile of barrels =\n * Based LPC base tiles by Lanea Zimmerman (AKA Sharm)\n= Decorational stuff (CC-BY-SA) =\n * Green bottle\n * Wine glass and bottle\n * Hanging sacks\n * Wall mounted rope and ropes\n * Wall mounted swords\n * Wall mounted kite shield\n * Wall hole\n By Tuomo Untinen\n * Small sack from LPC farming tileset by Daniel Eddeland (http://opengameart.org/content/lpc- farming-tilesets-magic-animations-and-ui-elements) \n * Purple bottles and gray lantern from Hyptosis Mage city\n * Green and blue bottle by Tuomo Untinen\n= Wall clock (CC-BY-SA) =\n * Lanea Zimmerman AKA Sharm\n * Tuomo Untinen (Scaled down and animation)\n= Stone floor (CC-BY-SA)= \n * Tuomo Untinen \n= Cobble stone floor (CC-BY-SA)= \n * Based on LPC base tileset by Lanea Zimmerman (AKA Sharm)\n= Cabinets and kitchen stuff including metal stove(CC-BY-SA) =\n * Based on LPC base tileset by Lanea Zimmerman (AKA Sharm)\n * Cutboard is made by Hyptosis\n * Sacks based on LPC farming tileset by Daniel Eddeland (http://opengameart.org/content/lpc- farming-tilesets-magic-animations-and-ui-elements) \n * Spears by Tuomo Untinen\n * Vertical chest by Tuomo Untinen based on LPC base tiles Lanea Zimmerman (AKA Sharm)\nManuel Riecke (AKA MrBeast)\n= Skull (CC-BY-SA) =\n * http://opengameart.org/content/lpc-dungeon-elements\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 0}
  m_fontSharedMaterials: []
  m_fontMaterial: {fileID: 0}
