      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Fuente: https://liberatedpixelcup.github.io/Universal-LPC-Spritesheet-Character-Generator/#?sex=child&body=Body_Color_bronze&head=Human_Child_bronze&expression=Neutral_bronze&hair=Side_Swoop_black&clothes=Child_shirts_white&legs=Child_pants_brown&eyes=Eye_Color_brown\nCr\xE9ditos literales del generador/p\xE1gina:\nbody/bodies/child/walk.png\n\t- Licenses:\n\t\t- OGA-BY 3.0\n\t\t- CC-BY-SA 3.0\n\t\t- GPL 3.0\n\t- Authors:\n\t\t- bluecarrot16\n\t\t- Benjamin K. Smith (BenCreating)\n\t\t- ElizaWy\n\t\t- MuffinElZangano\n\t\t- Durrani\n\t\t- Nila122\n\t\t- kheftel\n\t\t- Stephen Challener (Redshrike)\n\t- Links:\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/liberated-pixel-cup-lpc-base-assets-sprites-map-tiles\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-child-standing-template\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-children-walk-animation\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-male-jumping-animation-by-durrani\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-male-jumping-animation-by-durrani\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-jump-expanded\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-jump-expanded\n\nhead/heads/human/child/walk.png\n\t- Licenses:\n\t\t- OGA-BY 3.0\n\t\t- CC-BY 3.0\n\t\t- GPL 3.0\n\t- Authors:\n\t\t- Stephen Challener (Redshrike)\n\t\t- kheftel\n\t\t- bluecarrot16\n\t- Links:\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-child-standing-template\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-character-bases\n\nhair/swoop_side/child/walk.png\n\t- Licenses:\n\t\t- OGA-BY 3.0+\n\t\t- CC-BY 3.0+\n\t\t- CC-BY-SA 3.0\n\t\t- GPL 3.0\n\t- Authors:\n\t\t- JaidynReiman\n\t- Links:\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-1-hairstyle-2-hair-extensions-3-previously-unofficially-released-hairstyles\n\t\t- https://github.com/jrconway3/Universal-LPC-spritesheet/commit/46ddcf05a0e43e7aa6ffd47d350eef0eb529ac24\n\ntorso/clothes/shirt/child/walk/white.png\n\t- Licenses:\n\t\t- OGA-BY 3.0\n\t\t- CC-BY-SA 3.0\n\t\t- GPL 3.0\n\t- Authors:\n\t\t- Nila122\n\t- Links:\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-clothes-for-children\n\nlegs/pants/child/walk/brown.png\n\t- Licenses:\n\t\t- OGA-BY 3.0\n\t\t- CC-BY-SA 3.0\n\t\t- GPL 3.0\n\t- Authors:\n\t\t- Nila122\n\t- Links:\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-clothes-for-children\n\n--- Personaje LPC: Refugio \"Cuco\" (12) ---\nArchivo(s): cuco_12_walk.png\nAutor(es): bluecarrot16, Benjamin K. Smith (BenCreating), ElizaWy, MuffinElZangano, Durrani, Nila122, kheftel, Stephen Challener (Redshrike), JaidynReiman\nLicencia: GPL 3.0 (licencias comunes a todas las capas; elige una)\n  Licencias presentes en las capas: OGA-BY 3.0, CC-BY-SA 3.0, GPL 3.0, CC-BY 3.0, OGA-BY 3.0+, CC-BY 3.0+\nFuente: https://liberatedpixelcup.github.io/Universal-LPC-Spritesheet-Character-Generator/#?sex=child&body=Body_Color_olive&head=Human_Child_olive&expression=Neutral_olive&hair=Jewfro_black&clothes=Child_shirts_gray&legs=Child_pants_brown&eyes=Eye_Color_brown\nCr\xE9ditos literales del generador/p\xE1gina:\nbody/bodies/child/walk.png\n\t- Licenses:\n\t\t- OGA-BY 3.0\n\t\t- CC-BY-SA 3.0\n\t\t- GPL 3.0\n\t- Authors:\n\t\t- bluecarrot16\n\t\t- Benjamin K. Smith (BenCreating)\n\t\t- ElizaWy\n\t\t- MuffinElZangano\n\t\t- Durrani\n\t\t- Nila122\n\t\t- kheftel\n\t\t- Stephen Challener (Redshrike)\n\t- Links:\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/liberated-pixel-cup-lpc-base-assets-sprites-map-tiles\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-child-standing-template\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-children-walk-animation\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-male-jumping-animation-by-durrani\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-male-jumping-animation-by-durrani\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-jump-expanded\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-jump-expanded\n\nhead/heads/human/child/walk.png\n\t- Licenses:\n\t\t- OGA-BY 3.0\n\t\t- CC-BY 3.0\n\t\t- GPL 3.0\n\t- Authors:\n\t\t- Stephen Challener (Redshrike)\n\t\t- kheftel\n\t\t- bluecarrot16\n\t- Links:\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-child-standing-template\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-character-bases\n\nhair/jewfro/child/walk.png\n\t- Licenses:\n\t\t- OGA-BY 3.0+\n\t\t- CC-BY 3.0+\n\t\t- CC-BY-SA 3.0\n\t\t- GPL 3.0\n\t- Authors:\n\t\t- JaidynReiman\n\t- Links:\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-1-hairstyle-2-hair-extensions-3-previously-unofficially-released-hairstyles\n\t\t- https://github.com/jrconway3/Universal-LPC-spritesheet/commit/46ddcf05a0e43e7aa6ffd47d350eef0eb529ac24\n\ntorso/clothes/shirt/child/walk/gray.png\n\t- Licenses:\n\t\t- OGA-BY 3.0\n\t\t- CC-BY-SA 3.0\n\t\t- GPL 3.0\n\t- Authors:\n\t\t- Nila122\n\t- Links:\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-clothes-for-children\n\nlegs/pants/child/walk/brown.png\n\t- Licenses:\n\t\t- OGA-BY 3.0\n\t\t- CC-BY-SA 3.0\n\t\t- GPL 3.0\n\t- Authors:\n\t\t- Nila122\n\t- Links:\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-clothes-for-children\n\n--- Personaje LPC: Cuco (23) ---\nArchivo(s): cuco_23_walk.png\nAutor(es): bluecarrot16, JaidynReiman, Benjamin K. Smith (BenCreating), Evert, Eliza Wyatt (ElizaWy), TheraHedwig, MuffinElZangano, Durrani, Johannes Sj\xF6lund (wulax), Stephen Challener (Redshrike), ElizaWy, Matthew Krohn (makrohn)\nLicencia: MIXTA por capa (no hay una sola licencia com\xFAn a todas las capas; hay que cumplir la de cada capa, ver lista literal abajo)\n  Licencias presentes en las capas: OGA-BY 3.0, CC-BY-SA 3.0, GPL 3.0, OGA-BY 3.0+, CC-BY 3.0+\nFuente: https://liberatedpixelcup.github.io/Universal-LPC-Spritesheet-Character-Generator/#?sex=male&body=Body_Color_olive&head=Human_Male_Gaunt_olive&expression=Neutral_olive&hair=Jewfro_black&clothes=Longsleeve_gray&legs=Pants_brown&shoes=Basic_Shoes_brown&eyes=Eye_Color_brown\nCr\xE9ditos literales del generador/p\xE1gina:\nbody/bodies/male/walk.png\n\t- Note: see details at https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-character-bases; 'Thick' Male Revised Run/Climb by JaidynReiman (based on ElizaWy's LPC Revised)\n\t- Licenses:\n\t\t- OGA-BY 3.0\n\t\t- CC-BY-SA 3.0\n\t\t- GPL 3.0\n\t- Authors:\n\t\t- bluecarrot16\n\t\t- JaidynReiman\n\t\t- Benjamin K. Smith (BenCreating)\n\t\t- Evert\n\t\t- Eliza Wyatt (ElizaWy)\n\t\t- TheraHedwig\n\t\t- MuffinElZangano\n\t\t- Durrani\n\t\t- Johannes Sj\xF6lund (wulax)\n\t\t- Stephen Challener (Redshrike)\n\t- Links:\n"
