  m_text: "https://opengameart.org/content/orthographic-outdoor-tiles\n\nOPP2017 - Jungle and temple set\nOpenPixelProject.com\nCC0\nhttps://opengameart.org/content/opp2017-jungle-and-temple-set\n\n--- Vela animada (\"[LPC] Animated candle\") ---\nArchivo(s): tileset_altar/animated-candle.png\nAutor(es): kendallemm (colaboradores: HughSpectrum, William.Thompsonj)\nLicencia: CC-BY-SA 3.0 / GPL 3.0 / GPL 2.0 (la p\xE1gina ofrece estas opciones; elige una)\nFuente: https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-animated-candle\nCr\xE9ditos literales del generador/p\xE1gina:\nCopyright/Attribution Notice: Daniel Armstrong (AKA HughSpectrum), see the original work in the LPC assets for specific attribution instructions http://lpc.opengameart.org/static/lpc-style-guide/index.html\nDescripci\xF3n: Animated candle in the style of https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-animated-torch From Castle Lights repack: https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-castle-lights-repack Please feel free to make this animation better at: https://gitlab.com/kendallb/oga-lpc-candle\n\n--- Mesa con velas (\"LPC Tables Rework\") ---\nArchivo(s): tileset_altar/wooden_with_candles.png\nAutor(es): AntumDeluge\nLicencia: CC-BY-SA 4.0 / CC-BY-SA 3.0 / GPL 3.0 (la p\xE1gina ofrece estas opciones; elige una)\nFuente: https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-tables-rework\nCr\xE9ditos literales del generador/p\xE1gina:\nCopyright/Attribution Notice: Lanea Zimmerman (Sharm)\nDescripci\xF3n: Some LPC tables tilesets reworked for use in Stendhal. Original tilesets by Lanea Zimmerman. Details: Designed for use with 32x32 tiled maps. Orientation: orthogonal Dimensions: 96x128 Shadowless PNG images use indexed color (smaller files). Shadowed images & GIMP sources (.xcf) use RGB color (semi-transparent pixels). Licensing: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike (CC BY-SA) version 3.0 or later GNU General Public License (GPL) version 3.0 or later Links/Sources: [LPC] House Insides Candlesticks are licensed CC0 (based on CC0 vector image) Stendhal Git commit Notes: May add more reworked tilesets later. IMPORTANT: Currently, any changes I have made are licensed under CC0 so that original licensing can be used with attribution necessary to only the original author(s). E.g. You do NOT need to credit me. Attribution requirements may change with future edits. Original link: https://opengameart.org/node/81367\n"
