  m_text: "ARTE ORIGINAL DEL PROYECTO\nIm\xE1genes de los mosaicos, papel picado y llama de la vela: Fortino Romero Mantilla.\nP\xE9talo de cempas\xFAchil y Galer\xEDa de bocetos (Art/Resources/Galeria/): Fortino Romero Mantilla.\nEfectos de sonido S02\u2013S16 (Audio/Resources/Audio/): Fortino Romero Mantilla.\nM\xFAsica original M01\u2013M08 (Audio/Resources/Musica/), tema \xABMientras arda la vela\xBB y variaciones: Fortino Romero Mantilla.\nArte del campo (pirul, flores, huellas, vela): Fortino Romero Mantilla.\n\nMIENTRAS ARDA LA VELA\nDise\xF1o, programaci\xF3n e integraci\xF3n: Fortino Romero Mantilla\nUniversidad Tecnol\xF3gica de Puebla \u2014 Ingenier\xEDa de Software\n\nMotor: Unity 6 (Unity Personal)\nDi\xE1logos: Yarn Spinner para Unity (licencia MIT)\nTipograf\xEDa de interfaz: Liberation Sans (SIL Open Font License), incluida con TextMeshPro\n\nPENDIENTES DE REGISTRAR\nInterfaz y sonidos de interfaz: [pendiente]\nAmbientes y efectos: [pendiente]\nM\xFAsica: [pendiente]\n\nCREDITOS \u2014 Arte abierto (F01)\nGenerado el 2026-09-21, revisado el 2026-09-22 (v3: ojos caf\xE9s en todos los personajes; Rosa y Luc\xEDa en piel bronze; Cuco con Jewfro en las tres edades; credits.txt oficial de House interior).\nNota: las hojas LPC combinan capas de distintos autores; cada capa conserva su propia licencia (ver el texto literal de cada personaje).\nLos tilesets de la Parte B est\xE1n dentro de tilesets_OGA.zip en carpetas tileset_interior/, tileset_flores/ y tileset_altar/ (tambi\xE9n se descargaron sueltos como tileset_xxx__archivo).\n\n==================== PARTE A \u2014 PERSONAJES (Universal LPC Spritesheet Character Generator) ====================\nRepositorio: https://github.com/LiberatedPixelCup/Universal-LPC-Spritesheet-Character-Generator\n\n--- Personaje LPC: \xC1mbar (19) ---\nArchivo(s): ambar_walk.png\nAutor(es): Benjamin K. Smith (BenCreating), bluecarrot16, TheraHedwig, Evert, MuffinElZangano, Durrani, Pierre Vigier (pvigier), ElizaWy, Matthew Krohn (makrohn), Johannes Sj\xF6lund (wulax), Stephen Challener (Redshrike), JaidynReiman, Nila122, Lanea Zimmerman (Sharm), Ahmad3366\nLicencia: OGA-BY 3.0 (licencias comunes a todas las capas; elige una)\n  Licencias presentes en las capas: OGA-BY 3.0, CC-BY-SA 3.0, GPL 3.0, GPL 2.0\nFuente: https://liberatedpixelcup.github.io/Universal-LPC-Spritesheet-Character-Generator/#?sex=female&body=Body_Color_bronze&head=Human_Female_bronze&expression=Neutral_bronze&hair=Braid_black&clothes=Blouse_white&legs=Plain_skirt_maroon&cape=Solid_purple&shoes=Sandals_brown&eyes=Eye_Color_brown\nCr\xE9ditos literales del generador/p\xE1gina:\nbody/bodies/female/walk.png\n\t- Note: see details at https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-character-bases\n\t- Licenses:\n\t\t- OGA-BY 3.0\n\t\t- CC-BY-SA 3.0\n\t\t- GPL 3.0\n\t- Authors:\n\t\t- Benjamin K. Smith (BenCreating)\n\t\t- bluecarrot16\n\t\t- TheraHedwig\n\t\t- Evert\n\t\t- MuffinElZangano\n\t\t- Durrani\n\t\t- Pierre Vigier (pvigier)\n\t\t- ElizaWy\n\t\t- Matthew Krohn (makrohn)\n\t\t- Johannes Sj\xF6lund (wulax)\n\t\t- Stephen Challener (Redshrike)\n\t- Links:\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/liberated-pixel-cup-lpc-base-assets-sprites-map-tiles\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-medieval-fantasy-character-sprites\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-ladies\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-7-womens-shirts\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-jump-expanded\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-be-seated\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-revised-character-basics\n\t\t- https://gitlab.com/vagabondgame/lpc-characters\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-male-jumping-animation-by-durrani\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-runcycle-and-diagonal-walkcycle\n\nhead/heads/human/female/walk.png\n\t- Note: original head by Redshrike, tweaks by BenCreating, modular version by bluecarrot16\n\t- Licenses:\n\t\t- OGA-BY 3.0\n\t\t- CC-BY-SA 3.0\n\t\t- GPL 3.0\n\t- Authors:\n\t\t- bluecarrot16\n\t\t- Benjamin K. Smith (BenCreating)\n\t\t- Stephen Challener (Redshrike)\n\t- Links:\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-character-bases\n\nhead/faces/female/neutral/walk.png\n\t- Note: Original by Redshrike, Expressions by ElizaWy, mapped to all frames by JaidynReiman\n\t- Licenses:\n\t\t- OGA-BY 3.0\n\t- Authors:\n\t\t- JaidynReiman\n\t\t- ElizaWy\n\t\t- Stephen Challener (Redshrike)\n\t- Links:\n\t\t- https://github.com/ElizaWy/LPC/tree/main/Characters/Head\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/ulpc-expanded-expressions\n\nhair/braid/adult/fg/walk.png\n\t- Licenses:\n\t\t- OGA-BY 3.0\n\t\t- CC-BY-SA 3.0\n\t\t- GPL 3.0\n\t\t- GPL 2.0\n\t- Authors:\n\t\t- Nila122\n\t\t- ElizaWy\n\t- Links:\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/3-hairs-for-lpc\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-hair\n\ntorso/clothes/blouse/female/walk/white.png\n\t- Note: original princess.xcf by Sharm, edited to blouse by ElizaWy; adapted to v3 bases by bluecarrot16\n\t- Licenses:\n\t\t- OGA-BY 3.0\n\t\t- CC-BY-SA 3.0\n\t\t- GPL 3.0\n\t- Authors:\n\t\t- bluecarrot16\n\t\t- ElizaWy\n\t\t- Lanea Zimmerman (Sharm)\n\t- Links:\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/liberated-pixel-cup-lpc-base-assets-sprites-map-tiles\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-7-womens-shirts\n\nlegs/skirts/plain/thin/walk.png\n\t- Note: original by wulax, edited for female base by pvigier, edited for v3 base by bluecarrot16, idle & sit by Ahmad3366, color reduced & female sit/emote by JaidynReiman\n\t- Licenses:\n\t\t- OGA-BY 3.0\n\t\t- CC-BY-SA 3.0\n\t\t- GPL 3.0\n\t- Authors:\n\t\t- bluecarrot16\n\t\t- Pierre Vigier (pvigier)\n\t\t- Johannes Sj\xF6lund (wulax)\n\t\t- Ahmad3366\n\t\t- JaidynReiman\n\t- Links:\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-medieval-fantasy-character-sprites\n\ncape/solid/fg/walk.png\n\t- Licenses:\n\t\t- OGA-BY 3.0\n\t\t- CC-BY-SA 3.0\n\t\t- GPL 3.0\n\t- Authors:\n\t\t- bluecarrot16\n\t\t- JaidynReiman\n\t- Links:\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-curly-hair-elven-ears-white-cape-with-blue-trim-and-more\n\t\t- https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-roman-armor\n\t\t- http://opengameart.org/content/lpc-clothing-updates\n\ncape/solid/bg/walk.png\n\t- Licenses:\n\t\t- OGA-BY 3.0\n\t\t- CC-BY-SA 3.0\n\t\t- GPL 3.0\n\t- Authors:\n\t\t- Nila122\n\t\t- JaidynReiman\n\t- Links:\n"
